div.div:
1. MQTT Publish over TLS 1.2 (port 8883,
X.509 cert) reading out of range
Payload: {node_id, farm_id, plot_id, NPK}

6. Persists crop_alert_raised in records
Payload: {case_id, farm_id, plot_id,
focus: node_coords, alert_refs, opened}

13. Link restored: kit reports status
flight_completed with package digest;
requests upload grant via MQTT topic

17. Confirmation Lambda reads SQS;
reads S3 focus photos (verifies
person_screen = clear, PD-015)

20. Agronomist reviews draft order;
sets UTC window; assigns pilot_id;
sets product_batch_id (ADR-002, ASM-029)

23. Assigned pilot signs in with MFA;
downloads fumigation package (window,
polygon, no-fly, batch, authorizer_id)

26. Link restored: kit reports status
flight_completed (Order -> flown);
requests upload grant via MQTT

30. Pilot downloads verification
package; flies short pass over focus;
buffers photos & track offline

33. Verification Lambda reads SQS;
reads S3 verification photos & track;
checks person_screen = clear

34. DDB TransactWriteItems: writes result;
transitions Order executed -> closed &
Pest Case verifying -> closed (ASM-141)
